<resources>
    <string name="wgsetup_title">WireGuard setup</string>
    <string name="wgsetup_explainer">Connects the car to your home network through WireGuard. Addresses in AllowedIPs (for example your Home Assistant broker) are reached through the tunnel; everything else keeps its normal route. Use the peer (client) config your router exported, for example from OPNsense, Fritz!Box or wg-easy.</string>

